@startuml
title CloudSentinel example flow: ingestion → anomaly → recommendation → action plan → GitHub

actor User
participant Frontend
participant API
participant IngestAgent
participant AnomalyAgent
participant RecoAgent
participant DB
participant RAG
participant GitHub

User -> Frontend: Trigger ingest/demo
Frontend -> API: POST /api/cost/ingest-history
API -> IngestAgent: start ingestion
IngestAgent -> DB: upsert CostDailyRecord
IngestAgent -> API: return status

API -> AnomalyAgent: run detection
AnomalyAgent -> DB: read costs
AnomalyAgent -> DB: write CostAnomaly
AnomalyAgent -> RAG: index evidence

API -> RecoAgent: run compute-optimizer scan
RecoAgent -> DB: upsert OptimizationRecommendation
RecoAgent -> RAG: index evidence

API -> DB: create ActionPlan (pending_review)
Frontend -> API: Approve ActionPlan
API -> GitHub: create issue (if enabled)
GitHub --> API: issue URL
API -> Frontend: return issue link

@enduml
